{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26240","headline":"冬至酬刘使君 · 殷尧藩","name":"冬至酬刘使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"异乡冬至又今朝，回首家山入梦遥。\n渐喜一阳从地复，却怜羣沴逐冰消。\n梅含露蘂知迎腊，柳拂宫袍忆候朝。\n多少故人承宴赏，五云堆里听箫韶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}